2 CONT When Olga Serafia Kalenius was born on 3 September 1870, in Inkoo, Uusimaa, Finland, her father, Carl Fredrik Kalenius, was 41 and her mother, Erika Adolfina Zweygberg, was 26. She married Edvard Fredriksson on 23 October 1893, in
