2 CONT
2 CONT Paula Helga Louise "Pia" Louhikari Obituary
2 CONT LOUHIKARI, Paula Helga Louise "Pia" - In loving memory of Paula Helga Louise "Pia" Louhikari, (nee Wigren) 72 years, Monday, January 30th, 2012 at Health Sciences North, Sudbury. Beloved wife of Pauli Louhikari predeceased. Loving
2 CONC  mother of Tim and his wife Renata of Hockley Valley, Ontario. Cherished grandmother of Luke and Jake. Predeceased by her parents Harald and Katri Wigren. Pia's generous spirit and kind, warm heart will be deeply missed by all who
2 CONC  knew her. A private family funeral service will be held at the JACKSON AND BARNARD FUNERAL HOME. In lieu of flowers donations to the Northern Cancer Research Foundation would be appreciated. To light a memorial candle, flowers, d
2 CONC onations or messages of condolences available on-line at www.lougheed.org.
